# Face2Face DJ mock session: timed mock-sender commands, "<seconds> <command>".
# Read by tools/mock-sender (TypeScript) and by MockSource in face2face-core (Rust).
# It walks through everything Milestone 0 has to show: load, play, pitch change,
# loop jump, pause, master change and eject. "restart" loops it.

0     load 1
0     load 2
1     play 1
6     pitch 1 1.6129     # 124.00 -> 126.00 BPM
10    play 2
14    jump 1 -16         # loop jump: back 4 bars
18    pause 1
18    master 2
22    play 1
26    eject 2
29    load 2
32    play 2
36    pitch 2 -1.5
40    jump 2 32
44    restart
